  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now that it is proven you guys can check polys of models in game. How about having a slider or an option to disable avatars over a poly limit of your choosing? So you dont have to disable individually or by rank. \n\nThink of a potatoe user goes into world and has everyone automatically disabled over 10k polys. Smooth and clean transition.",
